title: metarecord-list:folder
tags: [[GUI command]] Metarecord
kind: reference
summary: List the selected metarecord's folder in the metarecord list (focused panel)

Lists the selection's folder — the folder itself when a folder is selected — as metarecords, in place of the focused panel: the query `mfr_path -> "<folder>"` lands in the normal DSL of the [[metarecord-list panel]] ([[Cross-panel selection]]), and the simplified query is emptied — or kept, AND-ed with the folder, after a last argument `and` (`metarecord-list:folder here and`). Defined in the shipped `gui/commands.js` ([[User commands]]).
